{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_scientist_01_01",
      "hash": "514b6d4ef4dcd574",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個月正在舉行\\n宇宙博覽會。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_juvenilem_01_01",
      "hash": "10f7633cdae62c4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "月之石啊……\\c\\n這個和路邊的石頭\\n到底有什麼不同啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "b1922d572e9219a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "人類首次踏足月球！\\c\\n至今已過了數十年……\\c\\n這次要前進的目標是\\n更加遙遠的紅色星球！\\c\\n無論何時，關於宇宙的\\n新聞都能讓我興奮不已呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_juveniles_01_01",
      "hash": "5cb2366d0b013951",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我呀，就是覺得[VAR POKNAME(0002)]好可愛！\\n好想要一隻喔！\\c\\n爸爸～\\n可以幫我捉一隻回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_01",
      "hash": "66105d63106ee55d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好啦好啦！\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]是吧！下次吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_02",
      "hash": "66105a63106ee044",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳和[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n今後似乎會變得更要好，\\r\\n那我可不能跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_fat_01_03",
      "hash": "66105b63106ee1f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]……\\n算了，已經這麼親近[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了，\\r\\n我也不好意思跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_01",
      "hash": "921e27ae1e5adf7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "太空船"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_02",
      "hash": "921e26ae1e5addcb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "掉落在月見山的物體。\\n應該是……月之石。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_03",
      "hash": "921e25ae1e5adc18",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是3D投影！\\n上面寫著「宇宙的地圖」。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_04",
      "hash": "921e2cae1e5ae7fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "隕石碎片"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_tenji_05",
      "hash": "921e2bae1e5ae64a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宇宙的形成"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_bg_01",
      "hash": "1bd115a03a3feafd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "參觀路線"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_bg_02",
      "hash": "1bd112a03a3fe5e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "透過顯微鏡\\n看到了一些漂亮的結晶！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t003r0102_max",
      "hash": "593271a4df38e148"
    }
  ]
}
